      "one_line": "Kyivan — tolerant feudal of the forest; piety, wealth.",
      "one_paragraph": "The Kyivan (Slavic) are a assertive feudal people seeded in forest, taiga, grassland. They prize piety, wealth, tradition, lean toward the military sphere, and field heavy_infantry, heavy_cavalry, archers. Outsiders are met as tolerant; their patrons touch trade, law, light."
